{"title":"Pickleball Beginner Skills & Play (15+): Nov 14-28 - $135/3 Classes","startsAt":"2026-11-14T10:30:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-14T12:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"📅 **Registration Required in Advance**\nRSVP’ing on Meetup does **not** reserve your spot.\n👉[ ](https://app.amilia.com/store/en/miles-nadal-jcc/api/Activity/Detail?activityId=kMQ2Bov)**[Register here](https://app.amilia.com/store/en/miles-nadal-jcc/api/Activity/Detail?activityId=k1j1v4q)**\n☎️ Or call **416-924-6211 ext. 0**\nSpaces are limited to ensure personalized instruction — early registration is encouraged!\n\n***\n\n## Pickleball Beginner Skills & Play (15+) at the Miles Nadal JCC\n\nHave you tried pickleball and want to feel more confident on the court? This **Beginner Skills & Play** program is the perfect next step!\n\nDesigned for players with **some familiarity** with pickleball, this small-group program helps you build a strong foundation through guided instruction, skill development, and beginner-friendly gameplay. Each session blends coaching, drills, and structured play so you can apply what you’re learning right away in a supportive, low-pressure environment.\n\n🏓 **What You’ll Work On:**\n\n* Review of basic rules, scoring, and court positioning\n* Developing proper technique for serves, returns, volleys, and rallies\n* Introductory doubles strategy and on-court decision-making\n* Applying skills through structured practice games\n* Individualized feedback and interactive Q&A with the instructor\n\n***\n\n📍 **Location:** Miles Nadal JCC — 750 Spadina Ave. (enter through Spadina doors)\n👥 **Format:** Small-group instruction led by an experienced, friendly coach\n🎾 **Equipment:** Paddles and balls are provided (or bring your own)\n\n***\n\n🧡 **Why Join?**\n\n* Build confidence and consistency in your game\n* Learn in a welcoming, beginner-friendly environment\n* Get comfortable playing real games, not just drills\n* A great bridge between Intro clinics and Drop-In play\n\n🔔 **New to pickleball?**\nIf you’ve never played before, we recommend starting with our **Intro to Pickleball Clinic**.\n\nWhether you’re looking to play recreationally, improve your skills, or prepare for more regular play, this program will help you feel confident stepping onto the court. Come learn, play, and have fun! 🏓","venue":{"name":"Miles Nadal JCC","address":"750 Spadina Ave - M5S 2J2, Toronto","lat":43.66664,"lng":-79.40382,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Drop-in Recreation - Volleyball, Basketball & Pickleball","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/c/4/b/highres_529064107.jpeg"}